{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57593","headline":"玉皇授歘生大洞三十九章与登龙台歌二章 二 · 无名氏","name":"玉皇授歘生大洞三十九章与登龙台歌二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匏河振沧茫，天津鼓万流。\n八风驾神霄，缅缅虚中游。\n咏洞神明唱，音爲汝玄投。\n歘生必至行，肘伏尘中趋。\n可爲苦心哉，当告尔所求。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}